  "answer": "You can test FastAPI endpoints using `TestClient` by importing it and creating a `TestClient` object by passing your FastAPI application to it. Then, you can use the `TestClient` object to send requests to your FastAPI application and write `assert` statements to check the responses.\n\nFor example:\n```python\nfrom fastapi.testclient import TestClient\n\napp = FastAPI()\n\nclient = TestClient(app)\n\nresponse = client.get(\"/endpoint\")\nassert response.status_code == 200\n```\n[reference/testclient-0]",
